    "result_text": "The change is complete and all tests pass. \n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented `contactPreference` on the owner API following the existing derived-field pattern (like `locality` and `membershipLevel`):\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 Added a read-only `contactPreference` string property to the `Owner` schema, so the generated `OwnerDto` gains the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../model/Owner.java`** \u2014 Added a `@Transient getContactPreference()` deriving `\"EMAIL\"` when an email is present (non-null, non-blank), otherwise `\"PHONE\"`. MapStruct auto-maps it into the DTO by name, consistent with the other derived getters.\n\nThe `@Email` field on `Owner` and the same non-blank check used by `getMembershipLevel()` keep the \"email present\" semantics consistent across the model.\n\n**Tests:** `BUILD SUCCESS` \u2014 `AcceptanceTest` (both `corePhoneWhenNoEmail` and `functionalityEmailWhenPresent`) and the full `mvn test` suite are green (2/2, 0 failures).",
